# AWS diagnose — read-only

- Use the skill WRAP only: `python "$SKILL_ROOT/scripts/aws_read.py" …`. Never raw mutating CLI/SDK.
- Do not guess Lambda names, log groups, or SSM paths — run `scan_sst.py` first.
- Write reports only under `.aws-details/reports/`. Redact tokens and sensitive bodies.
- Suggest fixes; never apply them in-account.
- Missing intake → ask once, then stop.
- AgentCore issues → `references/agentcore-handoff.md`, then `/agents-debug` /
  `/agents-build` / `/agents-optimize` / `/agents-harden` (mutating steps only
  after leaving diagnose).
